{
  "name": "Thunderous Smite",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your strike rings with thunder that is audible within 300 feet of you, and the target takes an extra 2d6 Thunder damage from the attack. Additionally, if the target is a creature, it must succeed on a Strength saving throw or be pushed 10 feet away from you and have the &amp;Reference[prone apply=false] condition.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot. </strong>The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 1.</p>",
